==Czech==

===Etymology===
Probably derived from {{term|bříza||birch|lang=cs}}, which starts to bud (and give sap) in March.<ref>{{R:Rejzek 2007}}</ref><ref name="machek">{{R:Machek 1968}}</ref> Or it might be derived from {{term|březí||gravid|lang=cs}}, because livestock is usually gravid in March.<ref name="machek" />

===Pronunciation===
*{{audio|Cs-březen.ogg|audio|lang=cs}}
